      "text": "Let's hit the      on our keyboard.\n  -(Or just click the     in your toolbar\nabove.\n\nUsing your mouse, select an individual\nshape on the canvas! The following\ntricks will not work with multiple\nshapes selected. (including groups)\n\n",
