      "versionNonce": 1377917206,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760933953891,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "`OBJECT`:\n\n- ANYTHING on the canvas that can be placed, resized, moved, rotated or\n  otherwise adjusted\n\n`GROUP`:\n\n- Single Canvas element containing 2 or more `Objects`\n- `Groups` can contain other `Groups`\n\n`BOUNDING BOX`:\n\n- The thin outline around all selected `objects`, that is always a square just\n  big enough to surround them all (decided by \"object\" position, size and\n  rotation).\n\n`HANDLES`:\n\n- Click-drag zones, shown on or around `bounding box` when `object`/`group` is\n  selected\n- Each `bounding box` typically has 4 distinct types of `handles` (9 total):\n  - Horizontal scale -- [2, left/right edges]\n  - Vertical scale -- [2, top/bottom edges]\n  - Diagonal scale -- [4, square, visible at `bounding box` corners]\n  - Rotation -- [initially above `object`, physically 'orbits' to maintain\n    position above original 'top edge' of `object`]\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "wOUDoWulMO2vkrmP6LgP3",
      "originalText": "`OBJECT`:\n\n- ANYTHING on the canvas that can be placed, resized, moved, rotated or\n  otherwise adjusted\n\n`GROUP`:\n\n- Single Canvas element containing 2 or more `Objects`\n- `Groups` can contain other `Groups`\n\n`BOUNDING BOX`:\n\n- The thin outline around all selected `objects`, that is always a square just\n  big enough to surround them all (decided by \"object\" position, size and\n  rotation).\n\n`HANDLES`:\n\n- Click-drag zones, shown on or around `bounding box` when `object`/`group` is\n  selected\n- Each `bounding box` typically has 4 distinct types of `handles` (9 total):\n  - Horizontal scale -- [2, left/right edges]\n  - Vertical scale -- [2, top/bottom edges]\n  - Diagonal scale -- [4, square, visible at `bounding box` corners]\n  - Rotation -- [initially above `object`, physically 'orbits' to maintain\n    position above original 'top edge' of `object`]\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
